## Acceptance criteria

- Every ticket left under {{ tickets_at }} is one `onefollowup ticket validate` reports sound,
  over the tree as it finally stands.
- `onefollowup check` reports the answers at `{{ answers }}` sound: every draft and input
  carries exactly one kind and one disposition, with what that disposition requires. Run it
  last, after the final edit to the answers.
- Every claim the report makes about what was staged is true of what the staging commands
  printed.

